<title>UK: Raine returns to modest year profit.</title>
<headline>Raine returns to modest year profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.07 profit	  vs 49.59 loss</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) nil		    vs 0.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     0.6 profit	   vs 102 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   447		    vs 510</p>
<p>NOTE - Housebuilding and contracting group Raine Plc chairman Roy Barber said on Tuesday that the impact of its 1995 reorganisation &quot;is now apparent&quot; and added: &quot;given reasonable market conditions progress will continue in 1996/1997 and accelerate in 1997/1998.&quot;</p>
</text>
